      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Higher up: fewer tests, each slower and more realistic. Lower down: many tests, each fast and exact.\nA rule is tested at the lowest level that can see it; the browser test only proves the parts are wired.",
      "originalText": "Higher up: fewer tests, each slower and more realistic. Lower down: many tests, each fast and exact.\nA rule is tested at the lowest level that can see it; the browser test only proves the parts are wired.",
